    "sections": {
        "description": "KnowledgeHub is a structured theme built for modern educational platforms, online academies, and knowledge-sharing websites. Its modular design allows flexible course layouts, interactive lesson pages, and well-organized content sections for tutorials, guides, and learning resources. Compatible with LMS plugins, quiz modules, and course management tools, KnowledgeHub streamlines learning workflows while maintaining clarity, readability, and engagement. The theme supports responsive navigation, custom widgets, and flexible page templates, making it suitable for academies, coaching centers, or online training portals of all sizes. Lightweight coding ensures fast performance and enhanced SEO, while integration with event calendars, discussion forums, and resource libraries keeps learners fully engaged. KnowledgeHub balances functionality and simplicity, providing a seamless platform to publish courses, manage lessons, and share high-quality educational content efficiently."
    },
